1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,124
Your English is not a talent.

2
00:00:02,124 --> 00:00:03,016
It is a muscle.

3
00:00:03,016 --> 00:00:04,799
And muscles only grow one way.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,208
Myth: you need a talent for languages.

5
00:00:08,208 --> 00:00:10,766
Fact: daily practice is what builds fluency.

6
00:00:11,966 --> 00:00:13,202
Here is the workout.

7
00:00:13,202 --> 00:00:15,303
Shadow a podcast for five minutes.

8
00:00:15,303 --> 00:00:17,219
Read out loud for five minutes.

9
00:00:17,219 --> 00:00:18,578
Write three sentences.

10
00:00:18,578 --> 00:00:19,999
And learn one new word.

11
00:00:21,199 --> 00:00:23,866
Fifteen minutes a day beats two hours once a week.

12
00:00:23,866 --> 00:00:25,733
Start today, and save this workout.

